sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant USR as User
    participant API as Upload API
    participant BLOB as Blob store
    participant PG as Postgres sections and registry
    participant AGT as Agent LLM

    rect rgb(235, 243, 255)
    note over USR,PG: Phase 1 - upload and index - deterministic code only, no LLM, no embeddings
    USR->>API: upload twilio-api.pdf
    API->>API: magic-byte sniff, size and page caps
    API->>BLOB: store PDF as-is
    BLOB-->>API: blob path plus capability URL
    API->>API: extract text in-process, pure Go converter
    API->>PG: sections rows with tsvector, GIN indexed
    API->>PG: registry row - name, description, TOC from PDF outline
    API-->>USR: 201 created - scanned PDFs warn no text layer here
    note over PG: derived layer - rebuildable from the blob anytime
    end

    rect rgb(255, 246, 235)
    note over USR,AGT: Phase 2 - agent turn - the only model in the loop
    PG-->>AGT: manifest injected at compose - names, descriptions, TOC
    USR->>AGT: how do I validate a Twilio webhook signature?
    AGT->>PG: documents.search webhook signature validation
    PG-->>AGT: Webhooks p.30 plus snippet
    AGT->>BLOB: document.read twilio-api.pdf pages 30 to 34
    BLOB-->>AGT: converted markdown of those pages
    AGT->>AGT: repeat search or read if needed
    AGT-->>USR: answer citing page 30 of the PDF
    end
